 We touch briefly on the future of AI.     The teaching methodology combines lectures, in-class and out-of-class exercises, and programming assignments.","topics":[],"score":210195,"global_rank":277905,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46508},{"name":"phytoporg/dotfiles","owner":"phytoporg","html_url":"https://github.com/phytoporg/dotfiles","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":5,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":210192,"global_rank":277907,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46509},{"name":"jschwarzwalder/Sort-XML","owner":"jschwarzwalder","html_url":"https://github.com/jschwarzwalder/Sort-XML","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Read in a file, process, export csv","topics":[],"score":210189,"global_rank":277910,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46510},{"name":"kairstenfay/political-twitter","owner":"kairstenfay","html_url":"https://github.com/kairstenfay/political-twitter","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"Making data visualizations of U.S. politicians and Democratic candidates","topics":[],"score":210188,"global_rank":277912,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46511},{"name":"codynhat/mmpool","owner":"codynhat","html_url":"https://github.com/codynhat/mmpool","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":null,"topics":[],"score":210187,"global_rank":277915,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46512},{"name":"colobas/obras","owner":"colobas","html_url":"https://github.com/colobas/obras","stars":0,"forks":1,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","description":"hard difficult expert very tough","topics":[],"score":210187,"global_rank":277916,"on_pypi":false,"top_pypi":false,"python_rank":46513},{"name":"gabesk/osmrenderer","owner":"gabesk","html_url":"https://github.com/gabesk/osmrenderer","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Python","desc